# The build context of apps/web/Dockerfile and apps/platform/Dockerfile. Each build needs the root
# manifests, the lockfile, tsconfig.base.json, its app, packages/ui and packages/api-client. The rest stays out.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.claude
docs
scripts
apps/api
apps/marketing
apps/mobile
apps/*/e2e
apps/*/test-results
apps/*/playwright-report
apps/*/blob-report
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
.vscode
.idea
